---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Description
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Encrypted packets over SpaceWire: the OpenCrypto framer cuts every input packet (for example a compressed image) into
-- chunks, the AES-GCM core encrypts every chunk with a generated IV and a 4-byte position in the AAD, and OpenSPP sends
-- every encrypted chunk as one Space Packet through an N-Char adapter and an OpenWire port.

